        {
          "text": " Wagonjwa hamkuwatia nguvu, wala hamkuwaponya wenye maradhi, wala hamkuwafunga waliovunjika, wala hamkuwarudisha waliofukuzwa, wala hamkuwatafuta waliopotea; bali kwa nguvu na kwa ukali mmewatawala. ",
