        {
          "text": " Bwana MUNGU asema hivi; Tazama, mimi ni juu ya wachungaji; nami nitawataka kondoo wangu mikononi mwao, nami nitawaachisha hiyo kazi ya kuwalisha kondoo; nao wachungaji hawatajilisha wenyewe tena; nami nitawaokoa kondoo wangu vinywani mwao, wasiwe tena chakula chao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
