        },
        {
          "text": "Maana, Bwana MUNGU asema hivi; Tazama, mimi mwenyewe, naam, mimi, nitawatafuta kondoo wangu, na kuwatunza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.11",
